weights."}], "Usage"], Cell["Details", "NotesSection"],
  Cell["Composite momentum slots contribute their implicit branches: \
Mom[Multiparticle[1,3]] is not treated as a single elementary insertion.",
   "Notes"], Cell["Physical PropDen factors are opaque to this score. The \
measure is a heuristic for selecting smaller algebraic representations, not \
an invariant of the amplitude or a proof of minimality.", "Notes"],
